 "remarks": "Welcome to 97 Richards Street, Unit D9, a spacious and inviting two-bedroom, two-bathroom condo offered furnished for a one-year lease. The open-concept living and dining area provides plenty of room to relax or entertain, with comfortable furnishings already in place for an easy move-in. Sliding glass doors bring in natural light and lead to a private covered deck overlooking a peaceful wooded setting-the perfect place to enjoy your morning coffee or unwind at the end of the day.  The bright kitchen features white cabinetry, generous counter space, and plenty of storage, while the adjoining dining area offers additional space for meals and gatherings. Both bedrooms are comfortably sized, and two full bathrooms provide added privacy and convenience. Additional features include in-unit laundry and ample storage throughout. Conveniently located near shopping, dining, commuter routes, and everything Norwalk has to offer.  A credit check is required, and applicants should have verifiable gross monthly income equal to at least three times the monthly rent. Two months' security deposit required, subject to applicable Connecticut law. No pets and no smoking.",
